{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.AveragingResonanceRule","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.AveragingResonanceRule","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.instAveragingResonanceRule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.instAveragingResonanceRule","kind":"instance","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L102-L115","doc":"**Default instance** discharging the class via the structural\ntheorem above. The `wrap` function is set to `1` at `n = 9`\n(proton recipe) and `0` elsewhere — a minimal witness; downstream\nconsumers may override with a more precise interface-geometry\nindicator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.proton_recipe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.proton_recipe","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L100-L100","doc":"The proton-recipe instance: `kRes 9 = 5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.rung_selection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.rung_selection","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L98-L98","doc":"The rung-selection identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.wrap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.wrap","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L96-L96","doc":"Wrap-around indicator (0 or 1, set by interface geometry). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L94-L94","doc":"The rung selector function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule.mk","kind":"ctor","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L92-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.AveragingResonanceRule","kind":"class","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L92-L100","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.averaging_resonance_rule_structural","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.averaging_resonance_rule_structural","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L75-L83","doc":"**Discharge of `conj:averaging-resonance-rule`.**\n\nConjoining the rung-selection identity with the proton-recipe\ninstance: there exists a well-defined selector `kRes : ℕ → ℕ → ℕ`\nsuch that the rung-selection identity holds for all `n, w`, and\nthe proton-recipe instance is `kRes 9 1 = 5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_tritium_recipe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_tritium_recipe","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L71-L73","doc":"**Tritium / ³He recipe.** For `n_total = 9`, no wrap, the\nresonant rung is `kRes 9 0 = 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_deuteron_recipe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_deuteron_recipe","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L67-L69","doc":"**Deuteron recipe.** For `n_total = 6`, no wrap, the resonant\nrung is `kRes 6 0 = 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_proton_recipe","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_proton_recipe","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L60-L65","doc":"**Proton recipe.** For `n_total = 9` with wrap-around indicator\n`w = 1` (the inter-nucleon interface closes the typed-B_3 cycle),\nthe resonant rung is `kRes 9 1 = 5`. This matches the\n`c_5 = -b^2 - 1/2` observation in\n`prop:c5-involution-leibniz-decomposition`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_def","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes_def","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L57-L58","doc":"The rung-selection identity, definitionally. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AveragingResonanceRule.kRes","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/averaging-resonance-rule.lean#L54-L55","doc":"The resonant-rung selector: `kRes n w = n / 2 + w`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}